msgstr "Qalab aan la aqoon."

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:323
msgid "Let AI assistants such as Claude, Cursor or VS Code work on this site for you through MCP (Model Context Protocol). They sign in as a WordPress user (Claude and ChatGPT by approving them here, others with an application password) and can do only what that user is allowed to do."
msgstr "U oggolow kaaliyeyaasha AI sida Claude, Cursor ama VS Code inay goobtan kuugu shaqeeyaan iyagoo adeegsanaya MCP (Model Context Protocol). Waxay ku soo galaan sidii isticmaale WordPress ah (Claude iyo ChatGPT adoo halkan ku ansixinaya, kuwa kalena erayga sirta ah ee codsiga) waxayna samayn karaan oo keliya waxa isticmaalahaas loo oggol yahay inuu sameeyo."

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:325
msgid "AI agents need WordPress 6.9 or later. Update WordPress to use them."
msgstr "Wakiilada AI waxay u baahan yihiin WordPress 6.9 ama ka dambeeya. Cusboonaysii WordPress si aad u isticmaasho."

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:338
msgid "Connection address (MCP endpoint)"
msgstr "Cinwaanka xiriirka (barta dhammaadka MCP)"

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:342
