msgstr "Claude iyo ChatGPT: taa beddelkeeda gal"

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:343
msgid "Add the connection address as a custom connector in Claude, or as an app in ChatGPT developer mode. They open this site so you can approve them; no password to copy."
msgstr "Ku dar ciwaanka xidhiidhka sidii xidhiidhiye gaar ah oo ku jira Claude, ama sidii app ku jira habka horumariyaha ChatGPT. Waxay furayaan goobtan si aad u ansixiso; ma jiro eray sir ah oo la koobiyeeyo."

